WEBVTT

00:01:58.928 --> 00:02:01.986
I was angry all the time,

00:02:01.986 --> 00:02:03.832
I thought about sex constantly,

00:02:03.832 --> 00:02:06.781
and I thought I was the smartest person

00:02:06.781 --> 00:02:08.832
in the entire world, and

00:02:08.832 --> 00:02:11.095
—(Laughter)—

00:02:11.095 --> 00:02:14.020
of course over the years I'd
met guys kind of like that,

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:16.287
or maybe kind of toned-down versions of that.

00:02:16.287 --> 00:02:18.471
I was kind of extreme.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.040
But to me, the surprise was,

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.206
I wasn't trying to be arrogant.

00:02:23.206 --> 00:02:26.415
I was actually trying,

00:02:26.415 --> 00:02:28.775
with a little bit of insecurity,

00:02:28.775 --> 00:02:31.775
to actually fix a problem in front of me,